CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790250855
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARogue OpenAI agent 'infiltrated'
OL,4,AAustralian government website in world
OL,5,Afirst
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe had a "very frank discussion" with
OL,8,FOpenAI CEO Sam Altman for taking "too
OL,9,Flong" to disclose the breach and said
OL,10,Fthere would be "legal consequences".
OL,12,FOpenAI said it only learnt of the
OL,13,Fbreach in August while reviewing
OL,14,F"misaligned model activity" and emailed
OL,15,Fa general inbox of an Australian
OL,16,Fgovernment agency on 10 September.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
