OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHarry Potter play producer says cost of
OL,4,Aliving made two-part show 'impossible'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The cost of living has gone up 30-40%
OL,7,Fsince the pandemic, including running
OL,8,Fshows," producer Sonia Friedman said in
OL,9,Fcomments reported by media at a launch
OL,10,Fevent. "The only way we could continue
OL,11,Fto run it as a two-parter would be by
OL,12,Fcharging an amount for the tickets that
OL,13,Fwould be unaffordable and
OL,14,Finaccessible."
OL,16,FThe two-part play, a sequel to JK
OL,17,FRowling's books, premiered in the West
OL,18,FEnd in 2016 and closed on 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
