OL,3,ATeen rocker Nene Royal becomes first
OL,4,AThai to win America's Got Talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FNene Royal, a 16-year-old rocker, has
OL,7,Fbeen crowned the latest winner of
OL,8,FAmerica's Got Talent - making her the
OL,9,Ffirst ever Thai winner of the
OL,10,Flong-running talent show.
OL,12,FFor the show's finals on Tuesday in
OL,13,FCalifornia, Nene, whose real name is
OL,14,FRattikarn Amloy, performed a rendition
OL,15,Fof Seven Nation Army by American rock
OL,16,Fduo The White Stripes.
OL,18,FHer heavy metal performances trumped
OL,19,Fnine other finalists, including
OL,20,Fmagician acts, canine performers and
OL,21,Feven a robot dance crew.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
